==Trivia==
*The word "''Void''" comes from the Latin "''vacuus''", meaning empty.
**In the Italian language settings of the game, the void's name is "Nihil", meaning "nothing" in Latin.
*The Void is the only [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] that deals less damage the more [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] are inside its radius.
*An [[Wizard/Evolution|Evolved Wizard]] is featured on the Void's [[Cards|card]] render.
*The Evolved Wizard, [[Ice Wizard]], and [[Electro Wizard]] are responsible for creating the Void, according to the Clash Royale [https://youtube.com/shorts/32qX1fEbxX4?si=KqXAuxOvVZ5QaMFP Void intro video]. 
*In the card's description, the "''You shall not pass!''" line is a reference to a quote mentioned by [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gandalf Gandalf] in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Lord_of_the_Rings The Lord of the Rings]. 
*The Void is the subject of 2 [[Emotes]].

